      "updated_at": "2025-01-16T10:14:09Z",
      "body": "I added a PR with discussed fixes (Only accepts specifically `ExceptionGroup[Exception]` and `BaseExceptionGroup[Exception]`. with a hopefully meaningful error message for others).\n\nA bit larger patch than I would've liked due to the need to handle them in tuples as well but seems to work well both on versions with native support and without. Was a bit unsure about where to add the tests so some feedback on the PR would be welcome.",
